            "value" : "找不到服务器地址。请检查服务器 URL。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server couldn’t be reached. Check the server URL and your internet connection, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Generic sync error",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
